<title>USA: Mission West Q1 shr $2.43 after gain.</title>
<headline>Mission West Q1 shr $2.43 after gain.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended</p>
<p>						   Feb. 28	  Feb. 29</p>
<p>							 1997	   1996</p>
<p> Revenues				   $48,857,000    $1,888,000</p>
<p> Costs and Expenses			43,770,000     1,749,000</p>
<p> Income Before Income Taxes	     5,087,000	 139,000</p>
<p> Income Taxes				 1,691,000	  56,000</p>
<p> Net Income				   3,396,000	  83,000</p>
<p> Net Income per Share			    2.43	    0.06</p>
<p>Average Number of Shares Outstanding</p>
<p>						  1,399,921     1,368,747</p>
<p>NOTES: 1997 results include the sale of a majority of the company's real estate assets, completed January 22, for a gain of about $4,849,000 before taxes. A special dividend of $9 was paid to shareholders during the first quarter. Full company name is Mission West Properties.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
